{
  "name": "Kinrel Cameo v2 — Modular Genetics-Aware Avatar System",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "Modular, swappable, genetics-aware 2D avatar parts for the Kinrel family-relationship platform. Generated with the locked MASTER STYLE LOCK. v2 implements 13 user-requested improvements over v1.",
  "project": "Daxelo Kinrel",
  "repository": "https://github.com/buildwith-manish/Daxelo-Kinrel",
  "tagline": "A Cameo is never a standalone avatar. Always a member of the family.",
  "v2_improvements": [
    "Multiple face variants per age (A/B/C/D) with different jaw/eye/nose/lip/ear shapes",
    "Skin tone layer (8 tones spanning the Indian skin spectrum) — applied separately, not baked in",
    "Hair separated into Front / Middle / Back — so buns, braids, ponytails have proper volume",
    "Accessories layer — glasses, earrings, turban, hijab, cap, hat, bindi, mangalsutra, nose-ring, headband, hair-clip — each isolated, never merged into hair",
    "Clothing by category (casual/formal/traditional/festival/winter/sports/office/school/baby/wedding) — not age-locked, resized to fit any age",
    "Face shape layer (oval/round/square/heart/diamond/long) — separated from facial features",
    "Nose variants (small/medium/broad/roman/button/round/sharp)",
    "Eyes variants (round/almond/large/small/droopy/deep-set/monolid/wide)",
    "Mouth variants (11 — neutral/soft-smile/big-smile/open-smile/laugh/sad/thinking/surprised/concerned/angry/sleepy)",
    "Eyebrows variants (thin/medium/thick/straight/curved/bushy/soft/high-arch)",
    "9 age stages (Baby/Toddler/Child/Preteen/Teen/Young Adult/Adult/Middle Age/Senior) — facial features vary appearance instead of redundant age bands",
    "Additive expressions — only eyebrows/eyelids/pupils/mouth/cheeks change; rest of face stays identical (Bitmoji-style consistency)",
    "Genetics system — children inherit features from parents; family resemblance emerges naturally"
  ],
